`actual-task.diff` is the updated unified diff generated directly from the three principal preimages to the fix-round-1 postimages. It is 41,781 bytes, contains 1,020 LF delimiters, and has SHA-256 `a0318c2c8f7659b4c77dfe8b95c76d0d9d15f9fedf12959c7c79de2df3bb7994`.

`fix-round-1.diff` is the narrow unified correction from the exact `review-freeze-01` source to the fix-round-1 postimages. It is 4,917 bytes, contains 111 LF delimiters, and has SHA-256 `053f3fcc07c49503d9d080574987a8786f79a808ebfcc6f15f957509157bc7a7`.

No further production edit belongs to this freeze unless an independent P2 review returns a bounded correction.
